NOTE ON DEPENDENCIES

This project depends on PyMuPDF, which is licensed under the GNU AGPL v3.
Distributing a modified, network-accessible version of this project may
therefore carry AGPL obligations for that component. If that is a problem for
your use case, replace the PDF extraction layer (backend/app/analyzers/
pdf_extractor.py) with a permissively licensed alternative such as pypdf; it is
isolated behind a single function for exactly this reason.
